== Correction (appended; the hashed criteria above are left as written) ==
The section headed "What the fifteen need" lists four groups totalling 19 tests, and the first commit message for this
item said "the other eleven of F-09's fifteen". Both are wrong about which tests are which. Part A's fifteen are
test_guard_real_outputs.py x11, test_absence_controls.py x3 and test_phase5a_tooling.py x1 (11 + 3 + 1). The four
demo tests are a further skip Part A recorded "in addition". So this item fixed none of the fifteen: it made the four
demo tests run in CI. The fifteen are unchanged, for the reasons given above. The commit message was amended before
any push; this note records that the criteria text carries the same error.
